    "text": "Let $a, a r, a r^2$, $\\qquad$ be an infinite G.P. If $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a r^n=57$ and $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a^3 r^{3 n}=9747$, then $a+18 r$ is equal to"
